Package: mtop
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nut-client
Description: terminal resource monitor with a UPS panel
 mtop is a fork of btop that shows CPU, memory, disk, network and
 process activity together with read-only UPS telemetry from NUT.
